[{"answer":"Lucy, we really need to get working on this marketing assignment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/1.mp3"},{"answer":"We've only got five weeks left to the end of term to design it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/2.mp3"},{"answer":"carry it out, and then write up the results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. Well, let's get started right now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's go over the instructions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What exactly do we have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it says here we have to look at one area of the entertainment industry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a list of the different types.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/8.mp3"},{"answer":"What are they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Music, cinema, theatre, sport, and eating out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Looks like it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So we choose one branch of the industry","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we look at how two different groups of people use it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And do we have to use any particular method to get our data?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Can we mail out a questionnaire, or do face-to-face interviews, or maybe even observations?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well actually, it looks like we don't have a choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We have to do telephone interviews.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so at least we don't have to waste time deciding between the different methods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and the other requirement is the number of interviewees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Not too many, I hope. Ten? Twenty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we have to do two groups, remember,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and it looks like we have to interview fifteen for each group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/26.mp3"},{"answer":"That's thirty altogether then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It's going to take ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but remember we're working on this together,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/29.mp3"},{"answer":"so we'll only have to do fifteen each.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so those are all the requirements?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, looks like it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/32.mp3"},{"answer":"So, first, which area are we going to choose?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/33.mp3"},{"answer":"My preference would be cinema, since that's where I spend most of my money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, I don't think that's such a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think there are huge differences in the market there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, you get young and old, male and female, rich and poor...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/37.mp3"},{"answer":"all going to the same movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, maybe you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's make it music then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what two groups will we compare and contrast?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Male and female?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/43.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Most of my female friends like the same music as me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Different age groups would be much more likely to show up differences, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I suppose you're right again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll take some notes, shall I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So... Age Groups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/49.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe 25 or under for one group, and 45 or over for the other group?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That should show up differences.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Next.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/54.mp3"},{"answer":"How about the kind of music they like? Let's give them some choices and then we can just tick boxes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Let's have pop, jazz, folk, easy listening...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/56.mp3"},{"answer":"What else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we should include classical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people like it, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And then we should have how they listen to music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/61.mp3"},{"answer":"The medium. Right. Let's include radio, CD...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I guess there's TV.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What about concerts? You know, in pubs and halls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, we should include live music of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, we're on a roll now!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Next point could be about where they actually get their music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/67.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean like, do they buy it in music shops, or department stores?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, or download it from the Internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. That could be for recorded music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we need another section for live music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Where do they go for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Let's say disco, pub, club, concert hall...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Or opera house!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/74.mp3"},{"answer":"And I guess we should include karaoke bars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Not many of them in this city!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. We'll leave that out then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/77.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what's left to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/78.mp3"},{"answer":"That's it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, now we can make a time-scale for doing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-3-part-3-2023-08-02-10-57-26/80.mp3"}]
